cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this MCP server, please cite it as below."
title: "@page2ai/mcp — MCP server that converts web pages to Markdown"
abstract: >-
  Model Context Protocol (MCP) server exposing a single page_to_markdown
  tool that fetches any web page URL and returns clean Markdown suitable
  for LLM context. Zero external APIs, SSRF-guarded, runs locally.
  Compatible with Claude Desktop, Cursor, Windsurf, and Zed.
type: software
version: 0.1.1
date-released: 2026-07-24
license: MIT
